          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "AMO.8.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Am 8:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.13.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 13:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamenyi bazotētērwa, n’abapfumu bamāramāre; mbere bose bazojorerwa, kukw ata co bishuwe kivuye ku Mana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.58.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 58:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko jeho nuzuye ubushobozi n’ ukuroranya n’inkomezi, mbihawe na Mpwemu w’Uhoraho, kugira ngo mmenyeshe Yakobo igicumuro ciwe, Isirayeli ndamumenyeshe icaha ciwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.3.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
